{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_88200",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A benzazepine that is 1,3,4,5-tetrahydro-2<em>H</em>-1-benzazepin-2-one in which the hydrogen attached to the nitrogen is replaced by a carboxy methyl group and in which the 3-<em>pro</em>-<i>S</i> hydrogen is replaced by the amino group of (2<i>S</i>)-2-amino-4-phenylbutanoic acid. An angiotensin-converting enzyme inhibitor, it is used as its monoester prodrug benazepril in the treatment of hypertension and heart failure."
  ],
  "synonyms": [
